# Generated files are written with LF by the scripts in scripts/.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF on checkout while the
# generators keep emitting LF, so `git status` reports them as modified after
# every build even though `git diff` is empty. Pinning them to LF makes the
# working tree agree with what the generators produce.
profile/README.md           text eol=lf
public/sitemap.xml          text eol=lf
scripts/sitemap-state.json  text eol=lf
